& Simulation & Sim-to-real \\
\midrule
Actor hidden dims    & $[256,256]$ & $[512,512,256,128]$ \\
Critic hidden dims   & $[512,256,$ & $[512,512,256,$ \\
                     & $128,128]$  & $256,128,128]$ \\
Activation           & ELU & ELU \\
Steps per env        & $24$ & $64$ \\
Mini-batches         & $4$ & $8$ \\
Learning rate        & $5\!\times\!10^{-4}$ & $1\!\times\!10^{-4}$ \\
